# The Android client lives inside this Laravel repo, so the repo-root .gitignore does not
# protect it: `/node_modules` there is anchored to the root and never matches
# `APK/<project>/node_modules`. Without the rules below, one `git add .` commits the release
# signing key and its passwords — and a leaked signing key lets anyone publish an APK that
# Android accepts as an update to the real one. It cannot be rotated without every installed
# copy breaking.

# Signing material — never commit.
*/android/keystore.properties
*/android/keystore/
*.jks
*.keystore

# Machine-local SDK path.
*/android/local.properties

# Build output and caches.
*/android/.gradle/
*/android/build/
*/android/app/build/
*/android/captures/
*/android/.externalNativeBuild/
*/android/.cxx/

# Regenerable from package-lock.json, and 30 MB of it.
*/node_modules/
